  "details": "The following strings are untranslated even if approved on Crowdin, most likely due to being outdated for some of them:\n\n- View available Bundles and Packs to claim! - When hovering \"Bundles & Packs\" (135913)\n\n- View your emoji and create new ones - When hovering \"Emojis\" (21977)\n\n- View your stickers and create new ones - When hovering \"Stickers\" (125270)\n\n- View your items - When hovering \"Items\" (138939)\n\n- View your customization options for UI, backgrounds, and cosmetic visuals. - When hovering \"Customization\" (141081)\n\nNote that for strings 21977, \"emoji\" should be \"emojis\"",
